notes.content:
This update brings the following changes:
 - Fixed a bug with the Crafter machine in the Schematic Tool;
 - General game stability improvements;

The update 1.0.2 brings the following changes:

- New schematic tool allows you to save your designs for later use;
- New "Alternator-Starter" machine;
- New "Dual-Starter" machine;
- New "Split-Selector" machine;
- More stats to the production window;
- More upgrades to different machines;
- You can now move the camera with the middle mouse button;

Blueprint changes:

- Adjusted resource requirements to craft "AI Robot Body";

Bug fixes:

- Uncraftable resources appearing in the resource selection window;
- Deleting a machine with its UI opened would crash the game;
- Deleting machines while moving them would change the machine count and money when it shouldn't;
- Leaving select-tool while moving machines would destroy them;
- Translantions text were appearing in wrong places;
- General stability fixes;
